<title>FRANCE: Barrot to meet French labour, union groups.</title>
<headline>Barrot to meet French labour, union groups.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Labour Minister Jacques Barrot said on Monday he would begin a round of meetings with labour and industry groups next Thursday to make 1997 a year of fruitful dialogue.</p>
<p>&quot;I will receive them with a desire to listen and speak to them about the common areas in which we can work together,&quot; Barrot said at a New Year's reception.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
